# Package F "Ecto": Pixel has the key to the stash (ecto_stash) that holds the a holo emitter.
%rec: OpeningBranch

cond: HasFlag('ecto_bribed')
goto: Bribed

cond: true
goto: Default

%rec: Nodes

name: Default
npc: I'm not doing anything. I'm just sitting here.
#
o_text: (Technology) Your signal is sloppy. I traced it from the club in two minutes. EBI will trace it in one.
o_id: ecto_talk
o_cond: HasFlag('JobAccepted(ecto)') && !HasItem('ecto_stash_key')
o_test: RollSkill('technology', 'Hard')
o_succ: Yield
o_fail: Refuse
#
o_text: Lou is paying me to find you. Pay me more.
o_id: ecto_bribe
o_cond: HasFlag('JobAccepted(ecto)') && !HasItem('holo_emitter') && !HasFlag('ecto_paid')
o_goto: Bribe
#
o_text: Why a ghost?
o_id: ecto_lore
o_goto: Lore
#
o_text: Bye.
o_id: ecto_bye
o_goto: Bye

name: Lore
npc: People believe in ghosts more than they believe in EBI. A ghost can empty a club. A fact can't. I'm studying.
#
o_text: Back.
o_id: ecto_lore_back
o_goto: Default

name: Yield
npc: (She goes pale.) EBI? No. No no. Take the emitter key, I'm out. Tell Lou it's over.
effect: StackTransferFrom(NPC, 'ecto_stash_key', 1)
effect: EndConversation

name: Refuse
npc: Nobody traced anything. Go away, old man.
effect: EndConversation

name: Bribe
npc: (She rolls her eyes.) Two hundred. Lou cheated my mom out of that club. The ghost stays.
effect: StackTransferFrom(NPC, 'gold', 200)
effect: SetFlag('ecto_bribed')
effect: EndConversation

name: Bribed
npc: Boo.
effect: EndConversation

name: Bye
npc: Don't trace me.
effect: EndConversation
